<title>HONG KONG: Perfectech 1996 year net HK$13.24 mln.</title>
<headline>Perfectech 1996 year net HK$13.24 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 7.85   vs 4.72</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  3.5    vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			  13.24  vs 7.94</p>
<p>    Turnover		   420.23 vs 326.98</p>
<p>    Company name	     Perfectech International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		June 16-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 June 19</p>
<p>NOTE - Perfectech International is a maker of plastic packaging products and novelties.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one-for-four shares held.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year-end to December 31 from April 30. Comparative figures are for eight-months ended December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is four H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 0.5 cents) vs 1.5 cents for eight months.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
